{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>In the third year</b> — The Gaon [Saadia] said: וצבא גדול is like ודי הוה צבה. And R. Moses ibn Bal'am said: that it is like 'a host upon man upon earth.' And in my opinion: that which is called by name enters between two things, as I explained: וירא ישראל על שפת הים מצרים מת — for the earth swallowed them, for thus it is written in the Song, and likewise here: וצבא גדול נגלה לדניאל במראות הלילה." "<b>and truth</b> — the matter." "<b>and understand the matter</b> — a verb, like: בין תבין את אשר לפניך." "<b>and understanding to him</b> — a noun. And because the accent (נגינה) is initially on the first letter, mil'el, like: עשה לי את החיל הזה. Or both are imperative, and the word [for 'say'] is lacking, and it should be said to him: this vision he did not reveal but concealed — perhaps so he was commanded."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {0 "Resolved הגאון as Saadia by standard convention. The verse examples cited appear truncated or paraphrastic; translated as they stand.", 3 "Reading ובעבור היות הנגינה תחילה באות הראשון שבה מלעיל hyper-literally; the syntax is strained and may reflect manuscript corruption."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:20:46.290481209Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}